                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "It is an extremely funny but short indie game. I like the wacky art style that reminds me of The Lego Movie. But the gameplay is very limited. The closest I can describe it is a railway shooter visual novel. You have two choices: say no or not say a word. Not saying a word usually leads to more funny one-sided conversations, but at the cost that the game just plays itself. For that, I only recommend the game at a deep discount.\n\n[quote]Follow us for more [url=https://store.steampowered.com/curator/45113328-Awesome-Adventure-Friends/] Awesome Adventures![/url] [/quote]",
